From b7b3902d1a3fa34279f967204d9dc2239ce74597 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Moussa Dia <mdiababa@outlook.com>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 21:51:09 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Store models in XGBoost's native JSON format instead of
 pickle

A pickle freezes the Python object of the XGBoost version that wrote it;
loading it with another version raises a warning and may break silently.
save_model()/load_model() use XGBoost's official, version-stable format.

- models/*.pkl converted to models/*.json (identical predictions, max diff 0.0)
- load_regressor / load_classifier helpers in src/models/common.py, used by
  the API, baselines, promotion, explainability and tests
- promote.py exports the champion with save_model()
---
 README.md                            |   7 ++++---
 models/xgboost_pm25_48h.json         |   1 +
 models/xgboost_pm25_48h.pkl          | Bin 1335232 -> 0 bytes
 models/xgboost_spike_classifier.json |   1 +
 models/xgboost_spike_classifier.pkl  | Bin 1060863 -> 0 bytes
 src/api/app.py                       |  20 ++++++++++++-------
 src/models/baseline.py               |  11 ++++++-----
 src/models/common.py                 |  28 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 src/models/explainability.py         |   5 +++--
 src/models/promote.py                |  12 +++++++-----
 tests/test_models.py                 |  11 ++++-------
 11 files changed, 67 insertions(+), 29 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 models/xgboost_pm25_48h.json
 delete mode 100644 models/xgboost_pm25_48h.pkl
 create mode 100644 models/xgboost_spike_classifier.json
 delete mode 100644 models/xgboost_spike_classifier.pkl

diff --git a/README.md b/README.md
index 5b9389c..788c7c9 100644
--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -351,7 +351,8 @@ latest version **only if, on the current test set**, it beats:
    retraining).
 
 The decision and the scores behind it are stored as tags on the model version. A
-promoted model is also exported to `models/*.pkl`, which the API serves on Render.
+promoted model is also exported to `models/*.json` (XGBoost's native, version-stable
+format, rather than a pickle), which the API serves on Render.
 With `MODEL_SOURCE=mlflow`, the API loads the champion straight from the registry.
 
 > **Current status, stated honestly:** the spike classifier is promoted. The
@@ -476,8 +477,8 @@ ml-project/
 │   └── processed/                   # Feature-engineered dataset
 │
 ├── models/
-│   ├── xgboost_pm25_48h.pkl         # Regressor: PM2.5 in 48h
-│   └── xgboost_spike_classifier.pkl # Classifier: spike in 48h
+│   ├── xgboost_pm25_48h.json         # Regressor: PM2.5 in 48h
+│   └── xgboost_spike_classifier.json # Classifier: spike in 48h
 │
 ├── reports/
 │   └── baseline_comparison.md       # Generated metric comparison
diff --git a/models/xgboost_pm25_48h.json b/models/xgboost_pm25_48h.json
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..74c6bc2
--- /dev/null
